@startuml
title E07 - Versioned configuration and atomic application
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
autonumber
actor "Primary caregiver" as Caregiver
boundary "A03\nApp routines" as A03
control "S01\nShared contracts" as S01
control "B06\nFleet/config" as B06
control "H08\nHub cloud link" as H08
control "H07\nHub lifecycle/config" as H07
control "N04\nNode lifecycle" as N04
Caregiver -> A03: Edit routine, mode or device configuration
A03 -> S01: Validate schema and versioned command
A03 -> B06: Create next desired version
B06 -> H08: Publish desired config over authenticated channel
H08 -> H07: Deliver complete immutable snapshot
H07 -> H07: Validate all fields; reject stale/invalid without partial mutation
H07 -> N04: Apply node-specific newer configuration during authorized window
N04 --> H07: Return applied/rejected version
H07 -> B06: Report actual applied version
B06 --> A03: Show desired, applied, pending or conflict
note over Caregiver,N04: Outcome - Configuration is all-or-nothing, monotonic and observable as desired versus actually applied state.
@enduml
